{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-44060","model_call":71,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"two minutes hate\" \"group exercise\" sameness)"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"two minutes hate\" \"group exercise\" sameness)"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_41_1809862877#0_2847585478","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q871","rank":1,"snippet":"\": \"What is Two Minute Hate? | 1984 Questions | Q & A | GradeSaver 1984 What is Two Minute Hate? describe it Asked by Cody F #415756 6 years ago 1/9/2015 6:01 AM Last updated by jill d #170087 6 years ago 1/9/2015 6:32 AM Answers 1 Add Yours Answered by jill d #170087 6 years ago 1/9/2015 6:32 AM The <cover>Two Minutes Hate is a ritual performed daily by all of the citizens in Airstrip One. During this two minute ritual, everyone watches a film of propaganda, which includes video of the Party's enemies. The citizens react angrily to these films and scream at the screen. The Party's purpose for this exercise is to stamp out the individuality of its citizens, as they share similar emotions and reactions. This is a group exercise that promotes sameness. </cover>Source (s) 1984\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"What is Two Minute Hate? | 1984 Questions | Q & A | GradeSaver\" , \"url\": \"https://www.gradesaver.com/1984/q-and-a/what-is-two-minute-hate-236631\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_41_1809862877#0_2847585478","rank":1,"relevance":3}]},"time":41},"model_calls":71,"document_judgments":47,"relevance_3":32,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
